# Chi Game
a social game platform that let's prople talk to each other and and play games
xo connect 4 backgommon uno and etc...


## Prepare
### protobuf + rpc
note: not a good idea to install globaly but ...
```bash
npm install -g @connectrpc/protoc-gen-connect-query
npm install -g @bufbuild/protoc-gen-es

```